{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"screen\": \"话到了嘴边，他先沉默几秒：说出口，关系会不会改变\",\n      \"source\": \"心里很清楚自己要说什么，正因为太清楚，又明白有些话一旦说出口，关系就会改变，所以格外谨慎。\",\n      \"type\": \"1\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿明确知道说出口会改变关系，屏幕稿改成疑问，变成了拿不准关系是否会改变。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"screen\": \"几次柔软的落音像一根温柔的刺：甜蜜的确认里已有一点鼻酸，越喜欢眼前的好，越想让这一刻慢一点 / 歌声忽然往上涌，像感情热切了一次；随后又轻轻呼出一口气，重新柔和下来，没有把心事说死\",\n      \"source\": \"到第12–14小节，先前小心收着的歌声忽然往上涌了一次，像感情终于忍不住说得热切了一些。可是第14–16小节，它没有继续冲向高潮，而像轻轻呼出一口气，重新回到柔和。声音短暂落稳，又漂起来一点，没有把心事彻底说死。 / 几次柔软的落音，像一根温柔的刺。\",\n      \"type\": \"7\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"屏幕稿把柔软落音带来的惆怅放到了歌声上涌、回落之前，改变了定稿中先上涌回落、再出现柔软落音的呈现顺序。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c19628de-5fce-40f0-b185-b8cb7e15f9f0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T014027185363Z", "elapsed_seconds": 291.906, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T01:45:19.111696+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a42931dacde90dfb647721705a77ebae78b19a876ee490934563428a1dacbed5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "no